SUMMARY:TDRR #9 Weekday Morning Ride\, Do the Hossler (22R)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nSweep: Cindy Herr\n\nCele
 brate the Tour de France and ride our Tour de Red Rose as a tribute to the
  event. This year you can win prizes just by RSVPing on Meetup and Riding 
 our Rides!\n\nFull Details on Our TdRR Page: [LBC's Tour de Red Rose Page]
 (https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&modu
 le_id=326153)\n\nTdRR ride details & start location are on the [TdRR Sched
 ule](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&
 module_id=340196).\n\nCue & GPX File: [Cue & GPX Files](https://routes.lan
 casterbikeclub.net/cue/mc-do-the-hossler-22r/)\n\nTour de Red Rose & LBC N
 otes:\n\nCheck Google Groups for Ride Conditions\, Route Changes and Weath
 er Updates. [Join here](https://groups.google.com/forum/?hl=en#!forum/lanc
 asterbikeclub) if you are not already part of this group.\n\nHelmets are m
 andatory\; please also plan to bring 1-2 water bottles\, and basic repair 
 kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nBeing a Meetup Memb
 er does not mean you are a club member. [Join here](https://www.lancasterb
 ikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148).\nYour RSVP is your ag
 reement to abide by the club's [Code of Conduct](https://lancbikeclub.club
 express.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984) and [
 Rules of the Road](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_
 id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159)\, and [Ride Waiver](https://lancast
 erbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=454318).
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3154402
 08/
