SUMMARY:Tuesday Training Ride 25R (A+) (22-24mph)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nFor the experienced group
  rider in good physical condition and capable of maintaining a steady pace
 . Few stops if any. Riders unable to maintain classified pace may be dropp
 ed. If unsure if this ride is for you\, it is recommended you try the "A" 
 ride option first\, which leaves from the same location a few minutes late
 r.\n\n**Average speed: 20-22mph**\n\n25 mile rolling route:\n\nOdd dates: 
 CC Tuesday Fitness Ride Odd Days (25R)\nEven dates: CC Tuesday Fitness Rid
 e Even Days (26R)\n\nFor links to both cues:\n[https://routes.lancasterbik
 eclub.net/?l=7&t&c&mi&k=tuesday%20fitness](https://routes.lancasterbikeclu
 b.net/?l=7&t&c&mi&k=tuesday%20fitness)\n\nShow & Go (please bring a cue if
  you are not familiar with the route).\nNo Leader (means that this ride wi
 ll not be cancelled due to weather).\nBring lights as needed.\n\nHelmets a
 re mandatory\; No ear buds or audible music playing devices. Please bring 
 water\, and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflat
 or).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we encourage 
 LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. RSVP also all
 ows us to contact you after the ride if needed. If you do not RSVP you are
  not covered by the club excess accident insurance policy\; only club memb
 ers who RSVP are covered. Being on Meetup does not mean you are a club mem
 ber. Join here- [https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60
 &club_id=257148](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60
 &club_id=257148)\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's Cod
 e of Conduct: [https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=2
 2&club_id=257148&module_id=323984](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/co
 ntent.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\nRules of the Road:
  [https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257
 148&module_id=325159](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?pa
 ge_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159)\nand\nRide Waiver: [https://lanc
 asterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=763523](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/docs.
 ashx?id=763523)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3154030
